{"id":831,"slug":"house-of-games","title":"House of Games","year":1987,"country":"United States","duration":102,"spine":399,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/831-house-of-games","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/f4cd870c9d0136001f98d8ec2ac268d3/qPf9kR60ROOrUxfCNGNl7HiYLiR48u_large.jpg","description":"\nThe Pulitzer Prize–winning playwright and screenwriter David Mamet sat in the director’s chair for the first time for this sly, merciless thriller. Lindsay Crouse stars as a best-selling author and therapist who wants to help a client by making restitution for the money he owes to a gambler. After she meets the attractive cardsharp (Joe Mantegna), her own compulsions take hold as he lures her into his world of high-stakes deception. Packed with razor-edged dialogue delivered with even-keeled precision by a cast of Mamet regulars, House of Games is as psychologically acute as it is full of twists and turns, a rich character study told with the cold calculation of a career con artist targeting his next mark.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"David Mamet","slug":"david-mamet"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Lindsay Crouse","role":"Dr. Margaret Ford","slug":"lindsay-crouse"},{"actor":"Joe Mantegna","role":"Mike Mancuso","slug":"joe-mantegna"},{"actor":"Mike Nussbaum","role":"Joey","slug":"mike-nussbaum"},{"actor":"Lilia Skala","role":"Dr. Maria Littauer","slug":"lilia-skala"},{"actor":"Walsh J. T.","role":"The businessman","slug":"walsh-j-t"},{"actor":"Willo Hausman","role":"Girl with book","slug":"willo-hausman"},{"actor":"Karen Kohlhaas","role":"Prison-ward patient","slug":"karen-kohlhaas"},{"actor":"Steven Goldstein","role":"Billy Hahn","slug":"steven-goldstein"},{"actor":"Jack Wallace","role":"Bartender, House of Games","slug":"jack-wallace"},{"actor":"Ricky Jay","role":"Vegas man","slug":"ricky-jay"},{"actor":"G. Roy Levin, Bob Lumbra, Andy Potok, Allen Soule","role":"Poker players","slug":"g-roy-levin-bob-lumbra-andy-potok-allen-soule